<title>SOUTH KOREA: South Korea's NLCF to seek cottonseed, rapeseed meal.</title>
<headline>South Korea's NLCF to seek cottonseed, rapeseed meal.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's National Livestock Co-operatives Federation (NLCF) said on Wednesday it will invite tenders for 15,000 tonnes of cottonseed meal and 15,000 tonnes of rapeseed meal by 11.00 a.m. (0200 GMT) on Friday.</p>
<p>Details for the tender are as follow:</p>
<p>-- Cottonseed Meal : 15,000 tonnes</p>
<p> POSITION   TONNE  SHIPMENT		 ARRIVAL/PORT</p>
<p>    ONE     8,000  Feb 9-28 (China)     Mar 5/Inchon</p>
<p>    TWO     7,000  Feb 9-28 (China)     Mar 5/Ulsan, Kunsan</p>
<p>-- Rapeseed Meal : 15,000 tonnes</p>
<p> POSITION   TONNE  SHIPMENT		   ARRIVAL/PORT</p>
<p>    ONE     8,000  Feb 24-Mar 15 (China)  Mar 20/Inchon</p>
<p>			 Feb 12-Mar 3 (India)</p>
<p>    TWO     7,000  Feb 14-Mar 5 (China)   Mar 10/Ulsan, Kunsan</p>
<p>			 Feb 2-21 (India)</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5651</p>
</text>
